{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"(someone say chisel? I'll be over in a sec lol)","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:31:42.941000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745017035209179177","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Leaf casually strolls through the old town. She likes riding Rush places but it's been a while since she simply walked somewhere. She continues her long held tradition of smiling and nodding to each tree she passes until she finds Harvard. \"Sorry to leave you out here all by yourself! Thought I'd stop by to see if there's anything I can do!\" <@313689699627696139>","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:51:22.515000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745021982701125746","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Just the lass I was hoping to see.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:51:52.614000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745022108945481889","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"The Mayor's house needs fixing. And you've just the tool to do it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:52:20.584000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745022226260164650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Oh! This?\" She takes the chisel out. It looks rather large in her small hands.","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:53:10.289000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745022434738044938","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"The words on the original cornerstone have been marred. We need to inscribe some with that chisel.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:54:36.806000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745022797616513513","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Trouble is, I have no idea what Hiram wrote.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:54:58.394000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745022888163278878","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"What do you think we should write?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:55:20.959000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745022982807879791","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Leaf taps her foot, thinking \"It's supposed to be something important, right? Like what we want to leave behind for others?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T20:59:24.860000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745024005802557531","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"It is important. Its sort of a fate of the world kind of thing.\" He says completely casually.","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:00:34.699000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745024298728685608","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Uh, right...\" She continues thinking. \"With everything going on, people saying the world is going to end and stuff, I've found it easier to go on knowing my 'truth', if that makes any sense. But this is going to be for everyone so it should be something for people to hang on to despite everything...\" She continues tapping her foot, until a hand goes to her holy symbol out of habit. Three words come to mind, \"Faith, hope and love.\" She lets the words hang for a second before looking a bit embarrassed. \"I don't know. Maybe it's stilly.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:16:38.982000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745028343224598668","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"He gives a wry smile. \"Well that'd certainly be a departure from anything that old codger would have written. But we see how far that government thing got him. If that is the values you want the masons to live up to, then by all means, set your inscription.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:19:31.237000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745029065714696334","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"She nods \"Masons are meant to build people up. You've got to have those things to do that, even if the world is ending.\" She looks at the chisel \"And... While I'm at it, I think I'll add the words in goblin as well. They're all the way in the Old World, but maybe somehow it'll reach them. Maybe someday in the future, it'll give someone like me hope, and they'll feel less alone.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:27:32.021000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745031082268950558","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Right. This sort of thing has never been my cup o tea. But have at it lass. We've more then one miracle to accomplish today.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:28:37.340000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745031356236693507","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"She begins inscribing the words. Had this been her first time using the chisel, she may have been more nervous, but something about this feels right to her. Her passion for calligraphy carries over here, and she works the words to not only say something meaningful, but look it too. *So long as you have breath in your lungs, build others with these tools: faith, hope and love.* The Common is easy enough to make look nice, the letters naturally swooping between each other. The Goblin is where Leaf puts most of her focus. A language that is hardly ever written, usually only for quick, crude messages. But Leaf has practice with this too, and hopes someone somewhere will appreciate it. The two languages sit beside each other, both carrying a message of hope for the world.","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:42:33.047000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745034861445906516","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"<@&731662851646816272> A new cornerstone has been set. A new tenant to live by \"So long as you have breath in your lungs, build others with these tools: faith, hope and love.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:48:12.946000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745036287085641739","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Good work there. Here, a good job deserves payment.\" He removes a bead from the Abacus.\n(Bead of Instant Karma. As a reaction, you can target one creature you can see that is about to attempt an ability check, attack roll, or saving throw, either granting advantage or imposing disadvantage on the roll. The bead crumbles to dust when used.)","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:50:35.222000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-17T21:50:50.133000Z","id":"745036883834175520","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Leaf steps back from her work and takes the bead with a smile. \"Thanks John! You said there was more to do here?\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:53:59.074000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745037738851696742","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Right. I've got a message to deliver to Florian about tha tool he's been using, a meteor to crash into the island, whiskey to drink, and sorting out a couple of dozen other messes. I'm going to need to try and find a way to meet more people in town.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:55:59.597000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745038244361535548","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"I'm headed back to the other colony. My servant Etrigan is going to keep repairing the town.\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:57:01.260000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-17T21:57:08.877000Z","id":"745038502995034134","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Well I'd be happy to help, just let me know where to start!\"","created_at":"2020-08-17T21:57:36.149000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745038649329975345","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
